  <data xml:space="preserve" name="About_Story_P1">
    <value>Autocamp Otesevo lies on the western shore of Lake Prespa, surrounded by centuries-old forests and endemic flora that make this area unique for relaxation, recreation, and total regeneration.</value>
  </data>
  <data xml:space="preserve" name="About_Story_P2">
    <value>With over 50 years of tradition, we offer bungalows, equipped camping pitches, direct access to the lake beach, and unforgettable sunsets over Prespa.</value>
  </data>
  <data xml:space="preserve" name="About_View_Prices">
