  </data>
  <data xml:space="preserve" name="About_Story_Full1">
    <value>Autocamp Otesevo was founded with the vision to offer all nature lovers an authentic experience along Lake Prespa. For decades, our camp has been a favorite destination for families, adventurers, and all seeking escape from daily city hustle.</value>
  </data>
  <data xml:space="preserve" name="About_Story_Full2">
    <value>We constantly improve our facilities — from comfortable bungalows and modern camping pitches to enhanced recreational amenities.</value>
  </data>
